OL,3,GNEWSARepairs for historic town hall
OL,4,Aafter chunks of masonry fell from
OL,5,Abuilding
OL,6,
OL,7,FA repair plan has been drawn up for a
OL,8,Fcategory A-listed town hall in southern
OL,9,FScotland after reports of "chunks of
OL,10,Fmasonry" falling from the building.
OL,12,FA conservation report on Lockerbie Town
OL,13,FHall warned it could be "quite
OL,14,Fdangerous" until remedial work has been
OL,15,Fcarried out.
OL,17,FThe building occupies a prominent
OL,18,Fposition at the corner of High Street
OL,19,Fand Bridge Street and is one of the
OL,20,Ftown's most significant civic
OL,21,Flandmarks.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
